    "decay": {"5d_ic": 0.01191465, "10d_ic": 0.01810954, "20d_ic": 0.03767414},
    "regime_notes": "20-day IC remained positive in chronological thirds: 0.04703183, 0.02459254, and 0.04139804. The factor is selective because it is active only in high-dispersion states; uncertainty is interpreted conservatively given the 15-asset universe."
  },
